flowchart TD
  A[Real-world intention: learner meaning] --> B[Draft Basic / Better / Natural EN]
  B --> C[Cambridge US grammar and pronunciation review]
  C --> D[COCA spoken usage and collocation]
  D --> E[YouGlish US usage check]
  E --> F[Wordlist coverage and exception log]
  F --> G[English approved?]
  G -->|No| B
  G -->|Yes| H[Character/scene brief]
  H --> I[Image generation: no text]
  I --> J[Visual editorial review]
  J -->|Fail| I
  J -->|Pass| K[Approved TTS production]
  K --> L[Audio QA and variant voices]
  L --> M[Separate unseen assessment bank]
  M --> N[Publication gate and versioning]
